@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+# Plan
+
+## Constraints
+- Use the existing `new_id` helper; no new dependencies.
+- Domain layer must not generate ids in `build_turn_messages`.
+- Each task leaves the full suite passing (update callers/tests in the same task).
+- Tests are written first and seen failing before the code.
+- Failed save: answer still delivered, `done` is the last event.
+
+## Task 1: `build_turn_messages` takes ids
+- Files: `src/pharma_agent/domain/conversation/turns.py`, `src/pharma_agent/application/chat/service.py` (temporary call site: pass `new_id()`), callers in tests (`tests/application/test_feedback_service.py`, `test_summarize.py`, `test_queries.py`, `tests/api/test_conversations_api.py`); test: `tests/domain/test_conversation.py`.
+- Interfaces: provides required kwargs `user_message_id`, `assistant_message_id`.
+- Test: `test_build_turn_messages_and_pair_turns` asserts the given ids are used.
+
+## Task 2: ids in session, events and result; drop error event
+- Files: `application/chat/service.py`, `application/progress.py`, `domain/agent/run.py`, `README.md`; test: `tests/application/test_chat_service.py`.
+- Interfaces: uses Task 1 kwargs; provides `ChatSession.user_message_id/assistant_message_id`, new event fields, `ChatTurnResult` fields.
+- Test: ids distinct and exposed; conversation event `message_id`; done event `message_id/persisted/created_at`; failure test asserts `done` is last, no `error` type.
+
+## Task 3: CLI warning
+- Files: `src/pharma_agent/cli.py`; test: `tests/test_cli.py`.
+- Interfaces: uses `done.persisted` from Task 2.
+- Test: `_render` of done with `persisted` False writes the message to stderr; True/absent writes nothing.
